{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with friends in this chaotic multiplayer hardware store simulator! Build your empire, sabotage competitors' pricing strategies, and handle the mayhem of daily retail operations - all while trying to become the town's premier hardware destination.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/store.png?t=1744983453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f CHAOS MEETS COMMERCE</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch products tumble as you and your staff race to restock shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with the physics-based chaos of retail life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate crowded aisles during flash sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantically reorganize displays to outshine competitors<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Shelving.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d TRUE COMPETITIVE MULTIPLAYER</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle up to 3 other players in the same bustling town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the real impact when competitors undercut your prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race to stock trending products before your rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your strategy as other players influence the market</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Hotdog-Man.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca DEEP RETAIL WARFARE</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically price items to steal customers from competitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor rival stores' tactics in real-time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn market events into opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your store to counter others' specializations<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Paying.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbc DYNAMIC RETAIL ECOSYSTEM</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a living economy that reacts to all players' actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch customers choose between competing stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create price wars that affect everyone's bottom line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with the ripple effects of other players' business decisions<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Ordering.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f KEY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based item interactions add unpredictable fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time competitive multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic market affected by all players' decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete store design freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep management systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employee hiring and management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warehouse logistics<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Store.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your store rise to the top through careful management, or will you embrace the chaos and outmaneuver your rivals? Jump into Hardware Store Simulator and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: The game supports single-player and multiplayer modes for up to 4 players.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Grand Opening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/2db8ff52c53327b458d13e380128b8669b8dcedb.jpg"},{"name":"Just The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/cfaf897df42294b0033d7bdc3bc3f7a07a3a4c92.jpg"},{"name":"Hardware Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/581aa6e08b6e7cc5db9732ef17dd79c2a00e1b91.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/b7f40aecb6cb9b17ce3228d79504ed07f8053ada.jpg"},{"name":"The Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/c45c68b430076e161a89a7d983f097bb2e444150.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/7a1cdd896554bc26c8c0bb7e60921b1ece47ea4d.jpg"},{"name":"Sales Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/e1685710c6cf6b92188dff0a4cbcb0fc791eba3e.jpg"},{"name":"Stock Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/3bfbc31b6db460c542bccc4125f7e5fb2c51efa6.jpg"},{"name":"Hardware Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/91832d3c3868085f853a5e457b41eed531e8481d.jpg"},{"name":"Retirement Plan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3358560/d7d0c02ade73321affb67cb244931a713719c143.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358560?t=1744983453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358560?t=1744983453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/4d113b91a7b86c66c45176b671b148d3d7b54982/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17449