ee hiring and management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warehouse logistics<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/extras/Store.gif?t=1744983453\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your store rise to the top through careful management, or will you embrace the chaos and outmaneuver your rivals? Jump into Hardware Store Simulator and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: The game supports single-player and multiplayer modes for up to 4 players.</i></p>","developers":["Stellar Fusion Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358560/header.jpg?t=1744983453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127639,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127639/movie480.mp4?t=1744967407","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127639/movie_max.mp4?t=1744967407"},"name":"Hardware Store - Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127639/c89faf7e8c31e8a74494d986ef5aba64516c5ca3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744967407","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127639/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744967407","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127639/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744967407"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257076759,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076759/movie480.mp4?t=1732669986","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076759/movie_max.mp4?t=1732669986"},"name":"Early Access Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076759/b0cb71d16d787d84b140af8